     https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swaywm/wlroots/master/protocol/input-method-unstable-v2.xml
     All request/event opcodes are retained, including unused popup/grab objects.
     Hardware grabs are used only by an explicitly enabled suggestion popup. -->
